OL,3,GNEWSAFalklands War veterans reunite at
OL,4,Anew factory build
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo veterans who survived an attack on
OL,7,Ftheir regiment during the Falklands War
OL,8,Fin 1982 have reunited to mark the next
OL,9,Fstage of a #15m factory building
OL,10,Fproject.
OL,12,FSimon Weston, 61, a former Welsh
OL,13,Fguardsman who suffered life-threatening
OL,14,Fburns during the bombing of the Sir
OL,15,FGalahad ship, put the first spade in
OL,16,Fthe ground at the Royal British
OL,17,FVeterans Enterprise's (RBVE) site in
OL,18,FAylesford on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
