OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFalklands War veterans reunite at
OL,4,Anew factory build
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was joined by Steve Hammond, who
OL,7,Falso served on the ship and went on to
OL,8,Fmake road and rail signs at Britain's
OL,9,FBravest Manufacturing Company (BBMC)
OL,10,Ffor 27 years.
OL,12,F"To see the new factory being built is
OL,13,Fgoing to be fantastic for the next
OL,14,Fgeneration of veterans," Hammond said.
